    "33_2008_L": "1\nBill No. 33-F of 2008\nTHE APPROPRIATION (VOTE ON ACCOUNT)\nBILL, 2008\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT—\nLOK SABHA  ON 14TH MARCH , 2008\nRAJYA SABHA ON 17TH MARCH, 2008)\nASSENTED TO\nON 25 MARCH, 2008\nACT NO. 5 OF 2008\n\n2\nShort title.\nBill No. 33-F  of 2008\nWithdrawal\nof   Rs.\n439219,87,00,000\nfrom   and\nout  of    the\nConsolidated\nFund of India\nfor financial\nyear 2008-09.\nAppropriation.\n  THE APPROPRIATION (VOTE ON ACCOUNT) BILL, 2008\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT)\nA\nBILL\nto provide for the withdrawal of certain sums from and out of the Consolidated Fund of\nIndia for the services of a part of the financial year 2008-09.\nBE it enacted by Parliament in the Fifty-ninth Year of the Republic of India as\nfollows:—\n1. This Act may be called the Appropriation (V ote on Account) Act, 2008.\n2. From and out of the Consolidated Fund of India there may be withdrawn sums not\nexceeding those specified in column 3 of the Schedule amounting in the aggregate to the\nsum of four lakh thirty-nine thousand two hundred nineteen crores and eighty-seven lakh\nrupees towards defraying the several charges which will come in course of payment during\nthe financial year 2008-09.\n3. The sums authorised to be withdrawn from and out of the Consolidated Fund by\nthis Act shall be appropriated for the services and purposes expressed in the Schedule in\nrelation to the said year.\n4. Reference to the Ministries  or  Departments  in  the Schedule  are  to such Ministries\nor Departments as existing immediately before 6th December, 2007 and shall on or after that\ndate be construed as references to the appropriate Ministries or Departments as\nconstituted from time to time.\nConstruction\nof references\nto Ministries\nor  Depart-\nments in\nSchedule.\n\nTHE  SCHEDULE\n(See sections 2, 3 and 4)\n12 3\nSums not exceeding\nServices and purposes V oted by Charged on the\nParliament Consolidated T otal\nFund\n             Rs.              